<# Skills block for the Deedy one-pager. Consumes data/skills.json (or an application's
   tailored subset of it). `after` on each line drives the LaTeX separator:
   break -> \\ ; par -> blank line ; parbreak -> \\ then blank ; omitted -> nothing. #>
<# TYPESETTING. This block sits in a 0.33\textwidth column. Set justified with hyphenation —
   TeX's default — it broke skill names mid-word ("Earth Foundation Mod-els", "Google Earth
   En-gine") and at their own hyphens ("Time-" / "series modelling"). So: ragged right, and
   each label an unbreakable \mbox with the only break offered after "|" (the `skillline`
   filter in scripts/lib/render.js).

   The \par before the closing brace is load-bearing. \raggedright sets \rightskip, and a
   paragraph's shape is fixed when the paragraph ENDS — so the last paragraph has to end
   inside the group, or it silently comes out justified again. #>
{\raggedright
<% for g in skills.groups %>
\subsection{<< g.title >>}
<% for line in g.lines %>
<< line.items | skillline >>
<% if line.after == "break" %>
\\
<% elif line.after == "parbreak" %>
\\

<% elif line.after == "par" %>

<% endif %>
<% endfor %>

\sectionsep

<% endfor %>
\par}
